explainer
Very interesting Claude Code/Codex skill: topic/document -> sourced
research -> narration -> TTS -> frame-accurate timeline -> storyboard
-> parallel Remotion shot construction -> quantitative QC ->
deterministic MP4. CPU-renderable and highly relevant to automated AGI
Everyone explainers, but commercial toolkit use requires authorization
