rigs/MetaHumans, streamed conversation, lip sync, gaze, emotion state,
long-term memory, actions, live streaming and multi-character scenes.
However, heavy AI runs through IAMX cloud and I could not establish a
qualifying new update this hour.

5) voqalize/avatar =E2=80=94 https://github.com/voqalize/avatar
Interesting lightweight Pipecat-native 2D avatar embodiment layer. It
derives avatar behavior directly from pipeline frames and minimizes
explicit avatar state/control. Useful architecture, but no verified
fresh material update.

